{"unit":59,"section":3,"cefr":"A1","objective":"form the past passive","skill":"Past Nif'al","heading":"Form the past passive","phrases":[{"he":"החורף נגמר.","en":"Winter is over.","audio":"https://d1vq87e9lcf771.cloudfront.net/he_v1/ed1bc01858c1aa2543c6f9f7b17df62e","tokens":[{"w":"החורף","h":["the winter"]},{"w":"נגמר","h":["over","finished","ended"]}]},{"he":"כשדיברתי איתו הוא נשמע שמח.","en":"When I spoke with him he sounded happy.","audio":"https://d1vq87e9lcf771.cloudfront.net/he_v1/87a8c7754805490d06297f9f09e60839","tokens":[{"w":"כשדיברתי","h":["when I spoke"]},{"w":"איתו","h":["with him","with it"]},{"w":"הוא","h":["he","him","(he) is"]},{"w":"נשמע","h":["sounded","sounds","sound"]},{"w":"שמח","h":["happy (sg. masc.)"]}]},{"he":"המכתבים האלה נכתבו על ידי סבתא שלי.","en":"These letters were written by my grandmother.","audio":"https://d1vq87e9lcf771.cloudfront.net/he_v1/3afa5d18da173adf8ba487bdc0bca90d","tokens":[{"w":"המכתבים","h":["the letters"]},{"w":"האלה","h":["these","those"]},{"w":"נכתבו","h":["were written"]},{"w":"על","h":["by","over","about","on top of"]},{"w":"ידי","h":["by"]},{"w":"סבתא","h":["grandmother","grandma"]},{"w":"שלי","h":["my","mine"]}]},{"he":"המזוודה שלי נאבדה בשדה התעופה.","en":"My suitcase was lost in the airport.","audio":"https://d1vq87e9lcf771.cloudfront.net/he_v1/75a50d8170134add0afa9068bd5a1bce","tokens":[{"w":"המזוודה","h":["the suitcase"]},{"w":"שלי","h":["my","mine"]},{"w":"נאבדה","h":["was lost"]},{"w":"בשדה","h":["at the airport","at the airfield","in the field"]},{"w":"התעופה","h":["at the airport","at the airfield"]}]},{"he":"כל ההצעות נשלחו לוועדה.","en":"All the proposals were sent to the committee.","audio":"https://d1vq87e9lcf771.cloudfront.net/he_v1/2c3f22adee500965ad5dc57cbf2d4d56","tokens":[{"w":"כל","h":["all of","all","entire"]},{"w":"ההצעות","h":["the suggestions"]},{"w":"נשלחו","h":["were sent"]},{"w":"לוועדה","h":["to the committee"]}]}],"words":[{"he":"סבתא","en":"grandmother","alt":["grandma"],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"בשדה","en":"in the field","alt":["at the airfield","at the airport"],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"החורף","en":"the winter","alt":[],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"נגמר","en":"over","alt":["ended","finished"],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"כשדיברתי","en":"when I spoke","alt":[],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"איתו","en":"with him","alt":["with it"],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"נשמע","en":"sounded","alt":["sound","sounds"],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"המכתבים","en":"the letters","alt":[],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"האלה","en":"these","alt":["those"],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"נכתבו","en":"were written","alt":[],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"המזוודה","en":"the suitcase","alt":[],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"נאבדה","en":"was lost","alt":[],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"התעופה","en":"at the airport","alt":["at the airfield"],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"נשלחו","en":"were sent","alt":[],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"לוועדה","en":"to the committee","alt":[],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"הוא","en":"him","alt":["he","(he) is"],"from":"phrase"},{"he":"שמח","en":"happy (sg. masc.)","alt":[],"from":"phrase"},{"he":"על","en":"by","alt":["over","about","on top of"],"from":"phrase"},{"he":"ידי","en":"by","alt":[],"from":"phrase"},{"he":"שלי","en":"my","alt":["mine"],"from":"phrase"},{"he":"כל","en":"all","alt":["all of","entire"],"from":"phrase"},{"he":"ההצעות","en":"the suggestions","alt":[],"from":"phrase"}],"lexemes":["נאכל","נשלחתי","נגמר","נאכלה","נקראו","נאבדה","נשמעו","ועדיין","נראו","נהננו","נגרם","נכתב","נפגשתְ","נשאלה","נפגשנו","נהנתי","נראינו","ניתן","שניתנה","נפרדנו","נגרמה","נסגר","נשארתי","נפגעו","נפתחו","נשארו","נזכר","נפגעתי","נעשה","נסגרו","נפגע","נעלמתם","נעשתה","נזכרתי","נסגרה","נעלמו","נשארתם","מאהבה","נשרפתי","נעשו","נפתחה","נשרפו","נעלמתְ"],"tips":"Here is the general pattern for the past tense of nif'al:\n\n|Example Verb|Pattern| Pronoun| \n|:--------:|:---------:|:-----------:|\n|נכנסתי (nikhnásti)| niXXaXti |אני|\n|נכנסתָ (nikhnásta)|niXXaXta|אתה|\n|נכנסתְ (nikhnást)| niXXaXt|את|\n|נכנס (nikhnás)|niXXaX|הוא|\n|נכנסה (nikhnesá)| niXXeXa| היא|\n|נכנסנו (nikhnásnu)| niXXaXnu|אנחנו|\n|נכנסתם (nikhnástem)|niXXaXtem|אתם|\n|נכנסתן (nikhnásten)| niXXaXten| אתן|\n|נכנסו (nikhnesú)| niXXeXu|הם|\n\nYou may have noticed that the third person masculine singular is pronounced identically to the masculine singular present in nif'al. Using the verb from the example above, הוא נכנס (hu nikhnás) can mean both \"he enters\" and \"he entered\". This was not always the case. Originally the two had vowels pronounced slightly differently but in modern Hebrew these vowels have merged together. You may have to go by context to decipher the meaning, although some modern native Israeli speakers use the word היה along with the past tense as a solution:\n\nIt sounded good to me - זה היה נשמע לי טוב"}